Id: boot012i
Severity: INFO
Category: boot
Check: check_secureboot
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-14, SI-7(9); ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

Secure Boot is on: the firmware verified the boot loader, and the boot
loader the kernel, against the keys enrolled in the firmware. The
message names the kernel's lockdown mode; when it is "none" or not
supported, lin040w explains what that leaves open. This is
informational.
